or:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"p1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"c\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">-18.2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"p2\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"c\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">-17.8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"power_state\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"connected\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"door_state\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"closed\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"power_events\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-09-12T11:02:00Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"to\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"disconnected\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"duration_min\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">47</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-09-12T11:49:00Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"to\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"connected\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"by\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"terminal_crane\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"cumulative_hours_above_alarm\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"remaining_hold_hours\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">96</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>两个字段值得强调：<code>power_events</code> 记录了每一次断电及其时长，这是判断&quot;断链发生在谁手上&quot;的直接证据；<code>remaining_hold_hours</code> 把温度历史折算成一个<strong>可用于排程的剩余时间预算</strong>，让下游知道还能等多久。前者用于定责（见 <a href=\"../coldchain-waste-ops/excursion-breach-liability-insurance\">断链定责与保险</a>），后者用于调度（见 <a href=\"../cold-customs-lastmile/local-cold-warehouse-turnover\">本地冷库周转</a>）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"港站冷链的三项基础设施\">港站冷链的三项基础设施</h3><p><strong>堆场冷藏箱插座密度</strong>。插座不足时，箱子落场后无法接电，只能排队等待或靠保温余量硬撑。插座密度直接决定了一个港口能否处理大批量冷链。</p>\n<p><strong>查验区的温控条件</strong>。查验需要开箱，而查验区往往没有冷藏条件。冷链货在常温查验区等待的时间就是纯损耗时间——因此口岸会设立<strong>冷链查验位</strong>，让开箱作业在有温控的环境下进行，缩短暴露时间。</p>\n<p><strong>冷链优先通道</strong>。易腐货物在口岸通常可以申请优先处理，这有国际规则支撑：WTO《贸易便利化协定》的目标是加速货物（含过境货物）的移动、放行与清关，并在实施上为发展中成员提供分阶段安排（<a href=\"https://www.wto.org/english/tratop_e/tradfa_e/tradfa_e.htm\">WTO, Trade Facilitation Agreement</a>）。生鲜作为易腐品是这类加速安排的主要受益对象，落地方式见 <a href=\"../cold-customs-lastmile/cold-chain-fast-customs-inspection\">冷链快速清关与查验</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>冷干线的设计目标是<strong>无干预前提下的确定性</strong>，三个环节是装箱预冷、在途维持、港站衔接。</li>\n<li>冷藏箱温域 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>65</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>40</mn><msup><mtext> </mtext><mo>∘</mo></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-65 \\sim 40\\ ^\\circ\\mathrm{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">65</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">40</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6741em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∘</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">C</span></span></span></span></span>，供电有堆场插座、发电机组、不供电三种模式，每次插拔都是一次温度漂移风险。</li>\n<li>海运适用大批量、空运适用高货值短航程（消耗型冷却约 100 小时上限），冷链拼箱只接受同温区拼装。</li>\n<li>四类在途失效：机组故障、通风失衡、冷热点、凝结水，需在设计阶段针对性冗余。</li>\n<li>衔接点的核心是把断电时长纳入排程，并按&quot;剩余可用在途时长&quot;做优先级调度。</li>\n<li>交接单必须携带断电事件与剩余持有时间，前者定责、后者调度。</li>\n<li>堆场插座密度、温控查验位、冷链优先通道是港站冷链的三项基础设施。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"冷藏集装箱、冷干线与港站衔接","id":"冷藏集装箱-冷干线与港站衔接"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"冷藏集装箱的构成与能力","id":"冷藏集装箱的构成与能力"},{"level":3,"text":"供电：三种模式","id":"供电-三种模式"},{"level":3,"text":"遥测与远程控制","id":"遥测与远程控制"},{"level":2,"text":"冷干线运输的组织","id":"冷干线运输的组织"},{"level":3,"text":"三种干线模式的取舍","id":"三种干线模式的取舍"},{"level":3,"text":"冷藏箱的四种典型失效","id":"冷藏箱的四种典型失效"},{"level":2,"text":"港站衔接：责任转移的工程化","id":"港站衔接-责任转移的工程化"},{"level":3,"text":"交接点为什么最危险","id":"交接点为什么最危险"},{"level":3,"text":"状态无损传递：交接单要带什么","id":"状态无损传递-交接单要带什么"},{"level":3,"text":"港站冷链的三项基础设施","id":"港站冷链的三项基础设施"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"温控 IoT/温度记录器与超温告警","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/perishable-coldchain-temperature-fulfillment/temperature-monitoring-transit/iot-temperature-logger-excursion-alarm"},"next":{"title":"批次效期 FEFO 与检疫库存","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/perishable-coldchain-temperature-fulfillment/temperature-monitoring-transit/lot-expiry-fefo-quarantine-stock"}}